(7716970, 1268841, 173844, '<td valign="top">Bit of a shoehorn, but I really like the image.  It''s so eerie that it''s on a street corner with sidewalks and curbs, but no other houses or human presence anywhere in the wide, grassy surrounds.  And terrific menacing clouds.  It''s either "we''re not in Kansas anymore," or, "yep, we''re in Kansas."</td>', 'Bit of a shoehorn, but I really like the image.  It''s so eerie that it''s on a street corner with sidewalks and curbs, but no other houses or human presence anywhere in the wide, grassy surrounds.  And terrific menacing clouds.  It''s either "we''re not in Kansas anymore," or, "yep, we''re in Kansas."', '2022-03-17 22:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
